NECROMANCER

Role: Undead summoner and offensive spellcaster.

Prime attributes: Intelligence and Piety.

Random base attributes before racial adjustments:
  Strength       8-14
  Dexterity      9-15
  Constitution  10-16
  Intelligence  14-18
  Piety         14-18

Class skill: Raise Corpse.
Universal skill: Conjure.

Raised undead disappear on logout, dismissal or death.
Conjured companions retain experience and levels
unless permanently killed or released.

Native Mage spellcasting and training remain available.

See HELP RAISE CORPSE, HELP CONJURE and HELP PETS.
